# Not part of the running site. Vercel serves every uploaded file that is not
# a function as a public static file, so anything listed here is simply never
# uploaded. host/ and package.json must stay (api/handler.js needs them);
# vercel.json redirects keep those from being read over the web.
/tests
/stress
/scripts
/.github
*.md
booking-inbox-script-template.gs.txt
.env.example
